  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 2.0.0 Alpha 7\n\n### Breaking Changes\n* Restructured ``IProcessInvoker`` interface with methods for ExecuteAsync, ExecuteBufferedAsync, and ExecutePipedAsync\n* Moved ``ApplyEnvironmentVariables`` extension method in CliInvoke.Core to DotExtensions\n* Removed ``TryApplyUserCredential`` extension method\n* Removed redundant constructor in ``ProcessConfiguration``\n* Removed ``IProcessStartInfoBuilder`` and ``ProcessStartInfoBuilder``\n* Renamed some ``IProcessFactory`` interface methods\n* Renamed ``ProcessExitInfo`` to ``ProcessExitConfiguration\n* Renamed ``IProcessExitInfoBuilder`` and ``ProcessExitInfoBuilder``  to ``IProcessExitConfigurationBuilder`` and ``ProcessExitInfoConfigurationBuilder`` respectively\n\n### Non-Breaking Changes\n* Re-added ``ProcessConfiguration``'s ``ToProcessStartInfo`` methods\n* Cleaned up ``ProcessInvoker`` code\n* Updated to DotExtensions 8.4.0 from 8.3.0",
